"A polished, high-converting vertical direct-response ad poster, designed like a premium agency Instagram/Facebook ad. Dense but organized layout, strong visual hierarchy, every text element crisp, legible and spelled exactly as written below in Brazilian Portuguese with correct accents. Nothing else written anywhere.

PALETTE AND MOOD: very dark background in a deep shade of the accent hue (#140B05), a soft glow of the same light as the photo, accents in #FF8A3D. emotional, intimate, hopeful. Subtle film grain.

TOP LEFT: the brand name "Coluna Leve" as a bold white wordmark in typography only, with no symbol, icon or logo next to it, and below it in small spaced caps "ROTINA NOTURNA DE 10 MIN".

TOP RIGHT: small spaced caps white text on two lines "MENOS DOR." / "MAIS VIDA." with a short #FF8A3D underline.

HEADLINE (huge, bold geometric sans-serif, left aligned, two to three lines): "Você não nasceu pra acordar" in white, continuing straight into "com dor." in #FF8A3D, read as one sentence.

SUBHEADLINE below it, medium size, light grey with the last sentence in white: "10 minutos antes de dormir. Sem academia, sem remédio. Do seu quarto.".

HANDWRITTEN ACCENT: a #FF8A3D brush-stroke banner, slightly tilted, with white handwritten script text "Sua manhã de volta." written with clearly separated letters, the same letters and accents as written, no extra accent marks, and a small curved underline.

HERO EMOTION (left edge, partly cropped by the frame, real and intimate): A woman in her forties in a grey knit sweater, sitting on the edge of her bed in a dim bedroom, one hand on her lower back, a tired but hopeful expression, eyes closed or looking down, brows drawn slightly together, shoulders a little tense, lit by warm lamp light on her face from the left. Realistic photo, real skin texture, not stock-looking.

CENTER, overlapping the photo: a modern smartphone mockup, tilted slightly, showing an abstract interface in dark mode (tilted slightly, overlapping the woman) with shapes, rings and simple icons and no readable words; the only words on the screen are the title "Hoje à noite".

RIGHT COLUMN: 4 stacked dark rounded cards with a soft glow border, each with a #FF8A3D rounded-square icon on the left, a bold white title and a grey one-line description:
1. icon a crescent moon: "Antes de dormir" / "Só 10 minutos por noite."
2. icon a single person silhouette: "Guiado passo a passo" / "Vídeo e voz em cada movimento."
3. icon a simple house: "Sem equipamento" / "Na cama ou no tapete."
4. icon a heart: "Pra quem tem dor" / "Movimentos leves e seguros."

TRUST STRIP above the bottom, three items separated by thin vertical lines, white icons and spaced caps text: a shield icon "FEITO PRA INICIANTES", a round clock face icon "10 MINUTOS POR NOITE", a lightning bolt icon "COMECE HOJE".

BOTTOM LEFT: a big glossy #FF8A3D pill-shaped CTA button with a white circle arrow icon on the left and the text "COMECE HOJE" (large, bold, white).

BOTTOM RIGHT: white handwritten script with clearly separated letters, tilted, on two lines "Seu corpo agradece." / "Sua manhã também.", with a #FF8A3D brush underline.

Keep the top 5% and the bottom 10% of the frame free of text and buttons, 4% margins on the sides; no element cut off except the person on the edge. No watermarks, no logos other than the wordmark, no extra words, no lorem ipsum, no misspellings.

